---
import { resume } from '../data/resume';
import { withBase } from '../lib/urls';
---
<section class="hero container"><div class="hero-copy">
<p class="eyebrow"><span class="status-dot"></span> BACKEND / AI ENGINEERING</p>
<h1>你好，我是<span class="name">周骏炜<span class="accent">。</span></span></h1>
<p class="hero-lead">让系统可靠运行，<br/>让 Agent 的结果可验证。</p><p class="hero-description">{resume.tagline}</p>
<div class="actions"><a class="button primary" href={withBase('projects/')}>探索我的项目 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="text-link" href={withBase('about/')}>关于我的经历 <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div>
<div class="hero-meta"><span>香港中文大学 · AI 硕士在读</span><span>{resume.location}</span></div></div>
<figure class="system-figure" aria-label="Agent 系统工程示意：任务经过工具执行和独立验证，形成可追溯记录"><div class="figure-top"><span class="mono">FIELD NOTES / 01</span><span class="figure-label">从执行，到证据</span></div>
<div class="system-board"><div class="board-axis" aria-hidden="true"></div>
<div class="system-node node-input"><span class="node-step">01 / INPUT</span><strong>理解任务</strong><small>Context · Intent</small></div><div class="flow-line" aria-hidden="true">↓</div>
<div class="system-node node-tools"><span class="node-step">02 / EXECUTE</span><strong>受控工具执行</strong><small>State · Permissions</small><div class="node-tags"><span>search</span><span>read</span><span>run</span></div></div><div class="flow-line" aria-hidden="true">↓</div>
<div class="system-node node-verify"><span class="node-step">03 / VERIFY</span><strong>用证据判定结果</strong><small>Tests · Trace · Recovery</small><span class="node-check" aria-hidden="true">✓</span></div><span class="board-note mono">OBSERVE → EXECUTE → VERIFY</span></div>
<figcaption><span class="tiny-dot"></span> 我关注的工程问题：状态、边界与真实反馈。</figcaption></figure></section>
